================================================================================
Third-party dependencies
================================================================================

This software builds on third-party open-source components, each under its own
license. The authoritative, version-resolved dependency list is generated at
release time from this repository's committed Cargo.lock. Notable runtime
dependencies include:

  - arrow-array, arrow-schema,   (Apache-2.0)      — columnar in-memory data;
    arrow-csv                                         CSV → RecordBatch reader
  - parquet                      (Apache-2.0)      — Parquet reader for CI checks
  - clap                         (MIT / Apache-2.0)— CLI parsing
  - serde, serde_json            (MIT / Apache-2.0)— serialization + NDJSON rows
  - serde_yaml                   (MIT / Apache-2.0)— contract document parsing
  - indexmap                     (MIT / Apache-2.0)— author-ordered models/fields
  - regex                        (MIT / Apache-2.0)— pattern constraints
  - semver                       (MIT / Apache-2.0)— contract version discipline
  - chrono                       (MIT / Apache-2.0)— timestamp/date validation
  - thiserror                    (MIT / Apache-2.0)— error handling
